' F17 -- Built versus deployed.
' Chapter 6 (Evaluation). Concept diagram.
' Claim supported: every feature flag in the project defaults to off, so the
' deployed product is a strict subset of the implemented one -- and three
' features are in inconsistent half-states rather than cleanly hidden.
@startuml f17-flag-reality
!include _style.iuml

title Built versus deployed — every flag defaults off

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}

rectangle "**IMPLEMENTED**\nbuilt, migrated, tested" as BUILT #F2F2F2 {
  rectangle "Lecture tutor" as A1
  rectangle "In-lecture quizzes" as A2
  rectangle "Study guide" as A3
  rectangle "Review engine (SRS)\nSM-2, swappable for FSRS" as A4
  rectangle "Student uploads\n'My Materials'" as A5
  rectangle "Exam mode\ncoverage-first sampling" as A6
  rectangle "Global search\n+ course tutor" as A7
  rectangle "Course brain\nconcept graph" as A8
}

rectangle "**REACHABLE BY A STUDENT TODAY**" as LIVE #BFBFBF {
  rectangle "Lecture tutor" as B1
  rectangle "In-lecture quizzes" as B2
  rectangle "Study guide" as B3
}

rectangle "**BROKEN HALF-STATE**\nfrontend flag ON, backend flag OFF" as HALF #DCDCDC {
  rectangle "Review / SRS\n//nav tab renders,\nAPI returns 404//" as C1
  rectangle "My Materials\n//page renders,\nrouter unmounted//" as C2
}

rectangle "**DEAD END**\nno frontend flag at all" as DEAD #DCDCDC {
  rectangle "Exam mode\n//'Generate exam' button always\nvisible, routes unmounted//" as D1
}

rectangle "**CLEANLY HIDDEN**\nboth flags off — the only consistent gate" as HID #F2F2F2 {
  rectangle "Global search + course tutor\n//no command palette,\nno 'Ask this course'//" as E1
}

rectangle "**SILENT CASCADE**" as CASC #DCDCDC {
  rectangle "Course brain off\n→ concepts write-idle\n→ review_cards.concept_id NULL\n→ concept_mastery empty\n→ record_grade() a no-op" as F1
}

A1 --> B1
A2 --> B2
A3 --> B3
A4 --> C1
A5 --> C2
A6 --> D1
A7 --> E1
A8 --> F1

note bottom of BUILT
  Not one flag in the codebase ships on:
  FEATURE_REVIEW_ENGINE, FEATURE_EXAM_MODE,
  FEATURE_GLOBAL_SEARCH, FEATURE_STUDENT_UPLOADS,
  FEATURE_COURSE_BRAIN, FEATURE_STUDY_GUIDE,
  FEATURE_LLM_PROMPT_LOGGING — all default False.
end note

note right of HALF
  **Flag parity is manual and duplicated.**
  The frontend reads build-time Vite env vars
  directly — featureFlags.ts:2-5 admits "no
  flag-delivery endpoint exists yet". It covers
  only 3 of the 7 backend flags, which is how a
  frontend-on / backend-off state arises at all.
end note

note right of DEAD
  **And local diverges from deployed
  structurally.** backend/.env enables three
  features, but .dockerignore:28 excludes
  **/.env from the image, so prod sees only
  the root .env. Locally 22 routers mount;
  prod serves 17-19. This is the documented
  cause of exam generation 404ing in prod.
end note

note bottom of CASC
  **The production default is the least-tested
  configuration.** conftest.py:32-33 force-sets
  FEATURE_REVIEW_ENGINE=1 and FEATURE_EXAM_MODE=1,
  so the suite never exercises the shipped state.
end note

legend bottom
  For the Evaluation chapter this reframes the question from "what was built?" to
  "what was delivered?" — a distinction most implementation theses never draw.
endlegend

@enduml
